		{
			dependencies: ["4058D1416D94BABB"]
			description: [
				"The alloy smelting furnace will produce fluid (the corresponding product can be produced through the mixing-electric blast furnace or carbon disulfide) and molten fluid. The molten fluid needs to be cooled using a vacuum freezer"
				""
				"Don't be put off by the long smelting time, this is a result of integrating the blender recipe directly into the smelting recipe and is actually less time consuming than mixing and then smelting the powder in a blast furnace (like stainless steel)."
				""
				"Almost all alloy materials can be produced on this machine, so if you have difficulty finding an alloy recipe, look for &b&lMolten Fluid &r!"
			]
